---
/**
 * /terms/ — Terms of Use.
 *
 * DELIBERATELY GENERAL. No legal entity, company number, registered address,
 * governing law, jurisdiction, arbitration clause, registered trademark or
 * dispute process is named, because none exists in the project. Inventing any
 * of them would be the single most damaging thing this page could do: a made-up
 * governing law is worse than none at all.
 *
 * The site is described as what it verifiably is — an informational editorial
 * website about small-space organization — and not as a retailer, shop,
 * consultancy, design service or manufacturer.
 *
 * This is website copy, not legal advice, and no compliance claim is made.
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/page/LegalPage.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="The general terms for using the SpaceWise Living website."
  bare
>
  <LegalPage
    eyebrow="Legal / Terms"
    title="Terms of Use"
    intro={`These Terms of Use describe the general terms for using the ${site.name} website.`}
    contactIntro="If you have a question about these terms, you can get in touch once a contact route is available."
  >
    <h2>Using this website</h2>
    <p>
      {site.name} is an informational, editorial website about small-space
      organization and storage ideas. It publishes articles and room guides to
      read. It is not a shop, a design or consulting service, a manufacturer or
      a retailer, and it does not sell products or take orders.
    </p>
    <p>
      You are welcome to read, use and share the ideas here. Please do not use
      the site in a way that disrupts it or interferes with other people's use
      of it.
    </p>

    <h2>Content and information</h2>
    <p>
      Everything published here is general information and inspiration. Homes,
      rooms and circumstances differ enormously, so an idea that works well in
      one space may not suit another.
    </p>
    <p>
      Nothing on this site is a guarantee of a particular result. No promise is
      made about how much space you will save, how a product will perform, how
      long something will last, or what any change will cost.
    </p>

    <h2>No professional advice</h2>
    <p>
      Organization and storage content here is general information, not
      professional advice. Judge it against your own space — your measurements,
      your fittings, your walls and floors, and what your household actually
      needs. Where a change involves structural work, fixings, electrics or
      anything load-bearing, or where you are unsure whether something is safe
      or permitted, consult a qualified professional and check any rules that
      apply to your building or tenancy.
    </p>

    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>
      The original text, design, layout and branding of this website belong to
      {' '}{site.name}. Please do not republish them wholesale as your own.
      Quoting a short passage with a link back is welcome.
    </p>
    <p>
      Material that belongs to other people — including anything reached through
      a link — remains theirs and is used or referenced under their terms, not
      claimed here.
    </p>

    <h2>Third-party links</h2>
    <p>
      This site links to other websites. Those sites are independently operated:
      we do not control their content, their policies, their prices, their
      availability or how they behave, and a link is not an endorsement of
      everything on the other end of it. Your dealings with them are between you
      and them.
    </p>

    <h2>Affiliate links and recommendations</h2>
    <p>
      Some links on this site may, in future, be affiliate links, which means a
      commission may be earned when a purchase is made through them. No
      affiliate programme has been set up and no affiliate links are published
      here today. Where such links do appear, they will be disclosed — see the
      {' '}<a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">affiliate disclosure</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      A recommendation is an editorial suggestion about what tends to help with
      a particular storage problem. It is not a warranty, and no promise is made
      that any linked product is in stock, still sold, or suitable for your
      space.
    </p>

    <h2>Accuracy and availability</h2>
    <p>
      Content may be edited, corrected, added to or removed at any time, and
      pages may move or be taken down. Information that was accurate when
      published may not stay that way — particularly anything about products,
      prices or availability on other websites, which we do not control.
    </p>
    <p>
      The site is offered as it is. No promise is made that it will always be
      available or free of errors.
    </p>

    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>
      You use this website and act on its ideas at your own discretion. To the
      extent permitted by law, {site.name} is not liable for loss or damage
      arising from using the site, relying on its content, or using any
      third-party website reached from it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Nothing here is intended to limit any right you have that cannot be
      limited by law.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>
      These terms describe the website as it is currently built, and will be
      updated as it develops — for example if a contact route, a newsletter or
      affiliate links are added. The date at the top of this page shows when the
      wording last changed.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
